        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Evaluate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\displaystyle \\prod_{k=1}^{4} \\dfrac{3k - 1}{6k - 1}.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Evaluate [MATH: \\displaystyle \\prod_{k=1}^{4} \\dfrac{3k - 1}{6k - 1}.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We expand the product by multiplying over the index <span class=\"math\">[MATH: k]</span> from <span class=\"math\">[MATH: k = 1]</span> to <span class=\"math\">[MATH: k = 4{:}]</span>\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: \u220f_(k = 1)^(4)(3k \u2212 1)/(6k \u2212 1)|= (3(1) \u2212 1)/(6(1) \u2212 1) \u22c5 (3(2) \u2212 1)/(6(2) \u2212 1) \u22c5 (3(3) \u2212 1)/(6(3) \u2212 1) \u22c5 (3(4) \u2212 1)/(6(4) \u2212 1); = (2)/(5) \u22c5 (5)/(11) \u22c5 (8)/(17) \u22c5 (11)/(23); = (2)/(5) \u22c5 (5)/(11) \u22c5 (8)/(17) \u22c5 (11)/(23); = (2 \u22c5 8)/(17 \u22c5 23); = (16)/(391)]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We expand the product by multiplying over the index [MATH: k] from [MATH: k = 1] to [MATH: k = 4{:}]\n[MATH: \u220f_(k = 1)^(4)(3k \u2212 1)/(6k \u2212 1)|= (3(1) \u2212 1)/(6(1) \u2212 1) \u22c5 (3(2) \u2212 1)/(6(2) \u2212 1) \u22c5 (3(3) \u2212 1)/(6(3) \u2212 1) \u22c5 (3(4) \u2212 1)/(6(4) \u2212 1); = (2)/(5) \u22c5 (5)/(11) \u22c5 (8)/(17) \u22c5 (11)/(23); = (2)/(5) \u22c5 (5)/(11) \u22c5 (8)/(17) \u22c5 (11)/(23); = (2 \u22c5 8)/(17 \u22c5 23); = (16)/(391)]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nEvaluate [MATH: \\displaystyle \\prod_{k=1}^{4} \\dfrac{3k - 1}{6k - 1}.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe expand the product by multiplying over the index [MATH: k] from [MATH: k = 1] to [MATH: k = 4{:}]\n[MATH: \u220f_(k = 1)^(4)(3k \u2212 1)/(6k \u2212 1)|= (3(1) \u2212 1)/(6(1) \u2212 1) \u22c5 (3(2) \u2212 1)/(6(2) \u2212 1) \u22c5 (3(3) \u2212 1)/(6(3) \u2212 1) \u22c5 (3(4) \u2212 1)/(6(4) \u2212 1); = (2)/(5) \u22c5 (5)/(11) \u22c5 (8)/(17) \u22c5 (11)/(23); = (2)/(5) \u22c5 (5)/(11) \u22c5 (8)/(17) \u22c5 (11)/(23); = (2 \u22c5 8)/(17 \u22c5 23); = (16)/(391)]"
      },
