            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We can collapse the given expression using product notation over the index <span class=\"math\">[MATH: i]</span> from <span class=\"math\">[MATH: i=3]</span> to <span class=\"math\">[MATH: i = 12{:}]</span></p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (2 \u2212 3^{2}) \u22c5 (2 \u2212 4^{2}) \u22c5 (2 \u2212 5^{2}) \u22c5 \u2026 \u22c5 (2 \u2212 12^{2}) = \u220f_(i = 3)^(12)(2 \u2212 i^{2})]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We can collapse the given expression using product notation over the index [MATH: i] from [MATH: i=3] to [MATH: i = 12{:}]\n\n[MATH: (2 \u2212 3^{2}) \u22c5 (2 \u2212 4^{2}) \u22c5 (2 \u2212 5^{2}) \u22c5 \u2026 \u22c5 (2 \u2212 12^{2}) = \u220f_(i = 3)^(12)(2 \u2212 i^{2})]",
